        </ctml:asOf>
        <ctml:publishedForEvent>false</ctml:publishedForEvent>
      </ctml:ratingSnapshot>
      <ctml:placement>1</ctml:placement>
      <ctml:notes>Final placement: 1st. Won QF-1 over Nihal Sarin 2.5-0.5, SF-1 over Firouzja 4-1, and the two-set final over Lazavik 6-2 in aggregate (3-1, 3-1). Tournament champion.</ctml:notes>
