      <ctml:notes>Final placement: 2nd. Won QF-4 over Abdusattorov 3-2 and SF-2 over Nakamura 3.5-1.5, then lost the two-set final to Carlsen 2-6 in aggregate (1-3, 1-3).</ctml:notes>
